2404..2478 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2479..2553 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2554..2632 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2633..2704 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2705..2780 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2781..2861 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2862..2938 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2939..3015 Comment "/// compose to `cong(loopOn, cong(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
3016..3088 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3089..3107 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
